# Normalize to LF everywhere by default. Without this, a Windows checkout (Git for Windows
# defaults to core.autocrlf=true) converts every fixture, snapshot and source file to CRLF, and
# the test suite's byte-for-byte comparisons against LF-only rendered output all fail — see the
# windows-build CI failures this was added to fix.
* text=auto eol=lf

gradlew text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.jar binary
*.gz binary
